# Secrets: by design these already live outside the repo, in the state dir
# (~/.harbor-eval-kit/secrets.env -- see getStateDir() in scripts/lib/harbor.ts), never
# written inside the project tree. These patterns are defense-in-depth only, in case
# HARBOR_EVAL_STATE_DIR ever points inside the repo or a .env gets created by hand.
secrets.env
**/secrets.env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

